Node / npm / Audit,Dependency maintenance and security audit,Dry-run safe,spark_tui_open npm
Resource Monitor,CPU memory disk processes and containers,Live,spark_plain_action resources
EOF

  cat >"${dir}/security.csv" <<EOF
Action,Scope,Status,Command
Open Supabase Admin,TLS 8443 restricted to ADMIN_CIDR,${admin_state},spark_plain_action open-admin
Close Supabase Admin,Remove the temporary admin gateway,${admin_state},spark_plain_action close-admin
TLS Certificates,Inspect validate and renew certificates,Managed,spark_tui_open certs
EOF

